sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub Service
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap
    participant Adapter as Adapter Container<br/>(K8s Job)
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>localhost HTTP
    participant LLM as LLM Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Flow 1: Standard Adapter Evaluation Job
    EvalHub->>ConfigMap: Create job configuration
    EvalHub->>Adapter: Schedule K8s Job
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Status: INITIALIZING<br/>HTTP localhost
    Adapter->>LLM: POST inference request<br/>TLS 1.2+ / API key (Bearer)
    LLM-->>Adapter: Model response
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Status: RUNNING_EVALUATION<br/>HTTP localhost
    Adapter->>LLM: POST inference request<br/>TLS 1.2+ / API key (Bearer)
    LLM-->>Adapter: Model response
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Status: POST_PROCESSING<br/>HTTP localhost
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Submit JobResults<br/>HTTP localhost
    Adapter->>OCI: Persist artifacts (optional)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Registry creds
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Status: COMPLETED<br/>HTTP localhost
    Note over Adapter: Job terminates

    Note over EvalHub,OCI: Flow 2: SWE-bench Child Job Orchestration

    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ChildJob as Child Job Pod

    EvalHub->>Adapter: Schedule SWE-bench K8s Job
    Adapter->>K8sAPI: Create child Job<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    K8sAPI->>ChildJob: Launch child pod
    ChildJob-->>K8sAPI: Pod completes
    Adapter->>K8sAPI: GET pods/log<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Adapter: Log results
    Adapter->>K8sAPI: DELETE child Job<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Submit JobResults<br/>HTTP localhost
    Note over Adapter: Job terminates
